// Package dictionary: free choice of childcare supplement (CMG, wave 3).
// The rules of `02-`–`09-` derive values from the pinned fragments; the
// case supplies the household situation, N-2 resources, the BMAF, the
// SMIC and CPI factors, the care expenses and the examination facts
// (provenance — case facts; BMAF and ceilings are neighbours
// `fr.pf.core`/`fr.tax.income_for_pf`, SMIC is `fr.travail.smic` — see
// README and boundaries).
//
// DEONTIC MAP OVER PINNED TEXTS ONLY (bytes of 01-sources.law; outside
// them — boundary, not conjecture).
//
//   D1. Duty of the fund to pay. «L'aide est versée par l'organisme
//   débiteur de prestations familiales» (L. 531-6, all wordings) +
//   «le complément est versé mensuellement ... sur justification des
//   dépenses» (D. 531-21, VI, reform). Triggers on the computed amount
//   plus the filed justification. The duty-holder in the texts —
//   the «debtor fund of the case» link is empirical
//   (fr.pf.core::organisme_debiteur_pf), performance is the empirical
//   fact cmg_verse. Window [@2021-01-01, ∞); tiers-payant variant
//   09.2024–02.2025 (direct payment to the association/enterprise).
//   D2. No «ne sont pas dues» exceptions in the CMG scope except the
//   age and hour gates, which are modelled as right conditions, not
//   defeaters: no defeaters.
//   N1/N2 (FINISH paje-cmg). L. 531-9, para. 1 «n'est pas cumulable»
//   (full-rate PreParE, then daily allowances for the same child) is
//   a prohibition concluded as a literal head
//   (cumul_prepare_plein_interdit / cumul_indemnite_interdit): the
//   result is a premise for the payment stage
//   (fr.prestations.versement, wave 5), not a registry row — the
//   phase-1 literal-head criterion. The VI exception («sauf si») is an
//   affirmative established fact prepare_plein_hors_vi (RETURN 2026-10-08:
//   missing evidence must not prove absence); prepare_verse_titre_vi
//   (positive) and prepare_plein_hors_vi (affirmative non-VI) are mutually
//   exclusive fund inputs. The 2014 NOTA cohort (born/adopted from
//   01.10.2014) is an explicit civil-record gate cohorte_l5319_2014 on the
//   PreParE bar (all periods — the 2014 reform cohort persists; see
//   journal); hors_cohorte_l5319_2014 is the affirmative pre-cutoff birth
//   input, mutually exclusive with the gate (FULL RETURN 03 — the same
//   input-pair shape as the VI exception). The 2025-12 cohort NOTA is a
//   civil-record gate on the daily-allowance bar. L. 531-9, para. 2
//   delegates the part-time
//   reduction to decree: the decree halves are already executed through
//   D. 531-21 (05/06, preparer_temps_partiel), so no new value rule — the
//   delegating norm is pinned and anchored here.
//   L. 531-8-1 «est minoré à hauteur de» builds the minoré levy from
//   two established amounts (prelevement_cesu_minore).
//   Recipient duties: declare specific hours on the expense attestation
//   (D. 531-22, I B); file the dematerialised declaration with the
//   recovery body within the deadline (D. 531-24 — CNAF-PFPAJE, read
//   never: boundary B-CMG-DECLARATION).
//   Powers: the fund controls specific hours yearly and recovers the
//   undue majoration (D. 531-22, I C) — power PouvoirRecouvrerMajoration.
//   No fund sanctions beyond recovery in scope; cross recovery under
//   L. 553-2 is package fr.prestations.versement (wave 5).
//   Time limits: monthly payment within one month of the justification
//   (D. 531-21, VI) — the deadline date is derived by the rule from the
//   justification date (add_calendar_period, B-PFAF precedent), the rule
//   records lateness.
//
// LAYER BOUNDARIES (omission records, not norms):
// B-CMG-BMAF: BMAF series (L. 551-1) — neighbour fr.pf.core; case fact.
// B-CMG-SMIC-REVALO: SMIC-growth factors of the 8/15 and 4.85/10.38
// figures remain unpinned (DSS/arrete) case inputs, DSS_PENDING.
// CMG resource ceilings use DSS-published bases and per-child supplements.
// B-CMG-FLOOR-EURO: RSA forfait figures (L. 262-2 amount for an isolated
// person with one child, R. 262-9 deduction) — neighbours fr.casf.rsa
// (wave 4); the floor FORMULA is built, the euro inputs are case facts.
// B-CMG-N2: N-2 resources under R. 532-1..8 — fr.tax.income_for_pf; case
// facts ressources_annuelles / revenu_mensuel_brut.
// B-CMG-EAJE-SEUIL: EAJE capacity threshold (R. 2324-46) and tariff-scope
// figures — external, case facts.
// B-CMG-AGE-BASE: the L. 531-1/D. 531-1 base age figure — fr.pf.paje
// (wave 3); ages arrive as fund-established facts.
// B-CMG-ARRONDI-EURO: monthly income rounded to the nearest euro
// (0.50 up, D. 531-18 2°) — round(., 0, HALF_UP) at the income rule.
// B-CMG-ARRONDI-CENTIMES: the final aid is rounded to cents for payment
// (payment mechanics, text names no rounding) — round(., 2, HALF_UP).
// B-CMG-FORMULE-NEGATIVE: at the 8500 ceiling the formula can yield a
// slightly negative aid; the text sets no floor — computed as is.
// B-CMG-FRATRIE: the most-favourable-sibling clause of the differential
// extinction — per-child rules; the cross-child maximum is not built.
// B-CMG-DECLARATION: D. 531-24 procedure (CNAF-PFPAJE) — read never.
// B-CMG-V-BIS-MORT-NE: L. 531-5 V bis (non-payment suspension, law
// 2025-199) is MODIFIE_MORT_NE — never in force, not pinned, no rule.
// B-CMG-TRANSFERT-18-1: old D. 531-18-1 ED2022 carries a TRANSFERE flag
// with fin 2025-06-13; the edition is kept continuous to 2025-09-01.
// B-CMG-L531-9-PREPARE (FINISH paje-cmg): the cross-benefit payment
// exclusion (CMG vs PreParE/daily allowance) needs the versement
// stage (fr.prestations.versement, wave 5); the markers conclude,
// individual amounts still compute (same class as B-PAJE2-COUPLE-CUMUL).
// B-CMG-L531-8-MONTANT (FINISH paje-cmg): L. 531-8 itself is unpinned
// (outside the FINISH group) and the L. 133-5-10/12 levy mechanics
// belong to the recovery body; both rule inputs are established facts.
// B-CMG-L531-9-COHORTE-2014 (FINISH paje-cmg, RETURN 2026-10-08: now
// modelled): the 2014-wording NOTA (children born/adopted from 01.10.2014)
// is the explicit civil-record gate cohorte_l5319_2014 on both PreParE-bar
// rules (all periods — adopted reading: the 2014 reform cohort persists
// through the 2025-09/2025-12 wordings for the unchanged para. 1 bar; the
// fund establishes birth/adoption dates). No isolated-parent fringe remains
// unproven. Pre-2014-10-01 children conclude NEITHER on the PreParE bar;
// the at-cutoff child (born 01.10.2014, «à partir du») carries the gate.
// hors_cohorte_l5319_2014 is the affirmative pre-cutoff input (FULL
// RETURN 03); neither input established stays a distinct NEITHER control.
//
// Scenarios: tests/cm-*.lawtest (families fr.pf.cmg#formule,
// #ancien-bareme, #structure, #cumul-alternance, #devoir-versement,
// #non-cumul in law.toml): inputs→value; boundary pairs (ceilings,
// 16h, 25h, 50%, ages 3/6/12, wording pairs
// 2024-09/2025-01/2025-02/2025-09/2025-12, FINISH 2019/2021-12 and
// 2014/2025-09/2025-12 non-cumul pairs);
// tests/devoir-versement-*.lawtest (positions: ACTIVE / no right /
// late); differential pairs (loss/no-loss, hours, 90% cap, extinction).
// FINISH paje-cmg adds tests/cm-non-cumul-*.lawtest and
// tests/cm-prelevement-minore-*.lawtest (family #non-cumul):
// prohibition markers TRUE vs NEITHER (affirmative hors-VI vs VI
// exception vs unevaluated when neither established; 2014 cohort gate:
// affirmative pre-cutoff vs at-cutoff TRUE vs unevaluated control;
// pre-2025-12 daily allowance with coherent pre-2026 facts; non-2026
// cohort), minoré levy built per wording.

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package fr.pf.cmg version "0.1.0";
namespace "urn:fr:corpus:clir:pf-cmg";

import fr.pf.core version "0.1.0";

pub enum ModeGarde {
    label fr official "mode de garde rémunéré (L. 531-5 et L. 531-6)";
    label en unofficial "paid care mode (L. 531-5 and L. 531-6)";
    ASSISTANT_MATERNEL,
    EMPLOYE_DOMICILE,
    STRUCTURE,
    EAJE
}

// --- Household case inputs (empirical) ---

pub relation ressources_annuelles(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "ressources annuelles du ménage, appréciées R. 532-1 à R. 532-8 (fait du dossier; série N-2 — fr.tax.income_for_pf)";
    label en unofficial "annual household resources under R. 532-1 to R. 532-8 (case fact; N-2 series — fr.tax.income_for_pf)";
}

pub relation revenu_mensuel_brut(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "ressources mensuelles brutes ramenées à une valeur mensuelle avant borne et arrondi (D. 531-18, 2°)";
    label en unofficial "gross monthly resources as a monthly value before clamping and rounding (D. 531-18, 2°)";
}

pub relation personne_seule(m: fr.pf.core::Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "la charge du ou des enfants est assumée par une personne seule (majorations, L. 531-5 III et L. 531-6)";
    label en unofficial "the child burden is borne by a single person (majorations, L. 531-5 III and L. 531-6)";
}

pub relation parent_isole(m: fr.pf.core::Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "parents isolés au sens du IV de L. 531-5 (âge limite porté à douze ans, D. 531-18-1)";
    label en unofficial "isolated parents under L. 531-5 IV (age limit raised to twelve, D. 531-18-1)";
}

pub relation nb_enfants_charge(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, n: Integer) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "nombre d'enfants à charge au sens de L. 512-1 retenu par la caisse (cohérent avec les faits enfant du cas)";
    label en unofficial "dependent-children count under L. 512-1 retained by the fund (consistent with the case child facts)";
}

pub relation enfant_aeeh(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant) kind empirical {
    label fr official "l'enfant ouvre droit à la prestation L. 541-1 (taux d'effort immédiatement inférieur, D. 531-18, 3°)";
    label en unofficial "child opens the L. 541-1 benefit (next-lower effort rate, D. 531-18, 3°)";
}

pub relation bmaf_retenu(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "base mensuelle retenue pour le mois du droit (arrêté, montant non épinglé)";
    label en unofficial "monthly base retained for the month of right (arrete figure, unpinned)";
}

pub relation facteur_smic(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, facteur: Decimal) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "croissance du SMIC constatée entre le 1er janvier de l'année précédente et le 1er janvier de l'année en cours (série — fr.travail.smic; SMIC_PENDING)";
    label en unofficial "SMIC growth between 1 January of the previous year and 1 January of the current year (series — fr.travail.smic; SMIC_PENDING)";
}

pub relation plafond_a_base_publie(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "base publiée du plafond a (instruction DSS, année du droit)";
    label en unofficial "published a-ceiling base (DSS circular, entitlement year)";
}

pub relation plafond_a_enfant_publie(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "majoration publiée du plafond a par enfant (instruction DSS, année du droit)";
    label en unofficial "published a-ceiling supplement per child (DSS circular, entitlement year)";
}

pub relation plafond_c_base_publie(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "base publiée du plafond c (instruction DSS, année du droit)";
    label en unofficial "published c-ceiling base (DSS circular, entitlement year)";
}

pub relation plafond_c_enfant_publie(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "majoration publiée du plafond c par enfant (instruction DSS, année du droit)";
    label en unofficial "published c-ceiling supplement per child (DSS circular, entitlement year)";
}

pub relation plafond_a_base_isole_publie(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "base publiée du plafond a pour parent isolé (instruction DSS, année du droit)";
    label en unofficial "published single-parent a-ceiling base (DSS circular, entitlement year)";
}

pub relation plafond_a_enfant_isole_publie(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "majoration publiée du plafond a par enfant pour parent isolé (instruction DSS, année du droit)";
    label en unofficial "published single-parent a-ceiling supplement per child (DSS circular, entitlement year)";
}

pub relation plafond_c_base_isole_publie(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "base publiée du plafond c pour parent isolé (instruction DSS, année du droit)";
    label en unofficial "published single-parent c-ceiling base (DSS circular, entitlement year)";
}

pub relation plafond_c_enfant_isole_publie(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "majoration publiée du plafond c par enfant pour parent isolé (instruction DSS, année du droit)";
    label en unofficial "published single-parent c-ceiling supplement per child (DSS circular, entitlement year)";
}

pub relation montant_forfaitaire_isole(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "montant forfaitaire L. 262-2 retenu pour une personne isolée avec un enfant (voisin fr.casf.rsa; fait du dossier)";
    label en unofficial "L. 262-2 forfait retained for an isolated person with one child (neighbour fr.casf.rsa; case fact)";
}

pub relation forfait_logement(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "forfait R. 262-9 déduit du plancher de ressources (voisin fr.casf.rsa; fait du dossier)";
    label en unofficial "R. 262-9 housing forfait deducted from the resource floor (neighbour fr.casf.rsa; case fact)";
}

pub relation mois_droit(mois: Date) kind empirical {
    label fr official "mois du droit apprécié (vaut normalement le mois de legal_time)";
    label en unofficial "appreciated month of right (normally the legal_time month)";
}

// --- Per-child case inputs ---

pub relation date_naissance(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, naissance: Date) kind empirical {
    key(e);
    label fr official "date de naissance de l'enfant (MIGRATION-REQ-CMG-01: en attente du pub fr.pf.core)";
    label en unofficial "child birthdate (MIGRATION-REQ-CMG-01: pending fr.pf.core pub)";
}

pub relation age_revolu_ans(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, annees: Integer) kind empirical {
    key(e);
    label fr official "âge révolu de l'enfant en années au mois du droit, établi par la caisse (seuils 3/6/12 ans)";
    label en unofficial "child completed age in years at the month of right, established by the fund (3/6/12-year thresholds)";
}

pub relation age_base_ans(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, annees: Integer) kind empirical {
    key(e);
    label fr official "âge de base du taux plein fixé à D. 531-1, établi par la caisse (voisin fr.pf.paje; fait du dossier)";
    label en unofficial "full-rate base age set by D. 531-1, established by the fund (neighbour fr.pf.paje; case fact)";
}

pub relation date_3eme_anniversaire(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, date: Date) kind empirical {
    key(e);
    label fr official "date du troisième anniversaire de l'enfant (extinction du différentiel, décret 2025-515 art. 3, III)";
    label en unofficial "date of the child third birthday (differential extinction, Decree 2025-515 Art. 3, III)";
}

pub relation mode_garde(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, mode: ModeGarde) kind empirical {
    key(m, e);
    label fr official "mode de garde rémunéré retenu pour l'enfant au mois du droit";
    label en unofficial "paid care mode retained for the child in the month of right";
}

pub relation heures_remunerees(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, heures: Decimal) kind empirical {
    label fr official "nombre d'heures d'accueil ou de garde rémunérées au mois du droit";
    label en unofficial "paid care hours in the month of right";
}

pub relation salaire_net_verse(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    label fr official "salaire net versé à la personne qui assure la garde de l'enfant au mois du droit";
    label en unofficial "net salary paid to the child carer in the month of right";
}

pub relation indemnites_entretien_repas(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m, e);
    label fr official "indemnités journalières d'entretien et frais de repas, assistante maternelle uniquement, 0 sinon (D. 531-18, 1°)";
    label en unofficial "daily care allowances and meal costs, childminder only, 0 otherwise (D. 531-18, 1°)";
}

pub relation cotisations_sociales(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    label fr official "cotisations et contributions sociales de la garde de l'enfant, établies par la caisse";
    label en unofficial "social contributions on the child care, established by the fund";
}

pub relation jours_remuneres(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, jours: Decimal) kind empirical {
    label fr official "jours de garde rémunérés au mois du droit (condition journalière SMIC, ancien D. 531-17)";
    label en unofficial "paid care days in the month of right (old D. 531-17 daily SMIC condition)";
}

pub relation smic_horaire_retenu(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "valeur horaire du SMIC retenue pour le mois du droit (série — fr.travail.smic; SMIC_PENDING)";
    label en unofficial "hourly SMIC retained for the month of right (series — fr.travail.smic; SMIC_PENDING)";
}

pub relation plafond_cotisations_domicile(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "plafond de la prise en charge 50 % à domicile, arrêté non épinglé (D. 531-17, II; DSS_PENDING)";
    label en unofficial "cap on the 50% home-employment coverage, unpinned arrete (D. 531-17, II; DSS_PENDING)";
}

pub relation indemnites_rupture_exclues(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m, e);
    label fr official "indemnités L. 1234-5 et suivants exclues de la vérification des plafonds III 6° (L. 531-5 éd. 2025-12, 0 avant)";
    label en unofficial "L. 1234-5 et seq. indemnities excluded from the III 6° ceiling check (L. 531-5 2025-12 wording, 0 before)";
}

pub relation depense_engagee(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    label fr official "dépense de garde engagée auprès de la structure ou de l'EAJE au mois du droit (L. 531-6)";
    label en unofficial "care expense with the structure or EAJE in the month of right (L. 531-6)";
}

pub relation heures_specifiques(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, heures: Decimal) kind empirical {
    label fr official "heures de garde en horaires spécifiques déclarées sur l'attestation (D. 531-22, I B, 0 par défaut)";
    label en unofficial "specific-hours care declared on the certificate (D. 531-22, I B, 0 by default)";
}

pub relation beneficiaire_aah(m: fr.pf.core::Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "la personne seule ou un membre du couple bénéficie de la prestation L. 821-1/821-2 (majoration L. 531-6, 2°)";
    label en unofficial "the single person or a couple member receives the L. 821-1/821-2 benefit (L. 531-6 2° majoration)";
}

pub relation horaires_atypiques(m: fr.pf.core::Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "horaires de travail spécifiques au sens du 1° de L. 531-6 (majoration D. 531-22, I)";
    label en unofficial "specific working hours under L. 531-6 1° (D. 531-22, I majoration)";
}

pub relation eaje_capacite(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, places: Integer) kind empirical {
    label fr official "capacité d'accueil simultané de l'EAJE (seuil décret R. 2324-46 — voisin; fait du dossier)";
    label en unofficial "EAJE simultaneous capacity (R. 2324-46 decree threshold — neighbour; case fact)";
}

pub relation eaje_seuil_capacite(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, places: Integer) kind empirical {
    key(m, e);
    label fr official "seuil réglementaire de capacité EAJE applicable (R. 2324-46, fait établi)";
    label en unofficial "applicable EAJE capacity regulatory threshold (R. 2324-46, established fact)";
}

pub relation eaje_tarif_horaire(m: fr.pf.core::Personne, e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    label fr official "tarification horaire appliquée par l'EAJE (périmètre — décret; fait du dossier)";
    label en unofficial "hourly tariff charged by the EAJE (scope — decree; case fact)";
